  "description": "Double Peak, a series inspired by a local riding spot not far from Haro, features a brand new frame design made from X6 series aluminum, with a low stand-over height and internal cable routing to keep things clean. The Sport model features a HL Vaxa 595 100mm fork with hydraulic lockout and a 2x8-speed drive-train with Shimano RapidFire 2x8-speed shifters. It rolls along on alloy double wall rims, stainless spokes and wider MTB specific Kenda 27.5\" x 2.35\" tires for 2021. The 27.5\" Sport is nimble and likes to go fast, but it can stop on a dime thanks to its efficient Shimano MT-200 hydraulic disc brakes.\nNew Double Peak X6 Series aluminum frame w/ tapered head tube\nHL VAXA 30S / 595 HLO 100mm travel fork\nAluminum crankset, 36-22T, 2x8\nShimano M315 2x8-spd front derailleur\nShimano SL-M315 RapidFire 2x8-spd shifters\nShimano Altus RD-310 rear derailleur\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32T cassette\nMX-21 27.5\"x27mm aluminum DW rims\nShimano BR-MT200 hydraulic brakeset\nShimano TX-505 hubs & Center Lock discs\nKenda Aptor 27.5x2.35\" tires",
